    "body": "## OWNER CONTROL — DURABLE STATE GUARD R01 / FAIL-CLOSED\n\nSCOPE = active #248 chain across VISUAL / INTEGRATION / LESTER / PRIME. SHERIFF observes enforcement. This is NOT new architecture, NOT canon mutation, NOT a new gate.\n\nMANDATORY BEFORE EVERY ACTION / RETRY / ROUTE / WRITE:\n1. Fresh-read #248 plus all newer relevant durable arbitration / Integration / PRIME evidence actually accessible.\n2. Reconstruct `CURRENT_VALID_STATE` from authority + evidence. Do NOT mechanically trust the newest comment timestamp.\n3. Previous task memory / previous NEXT / chat memory / cached state / hidden workspace output are not current authority.\n4. If local state conflicts with newer valid durable state: `STALE_STATE_ABORT`; `LOCAL_STATE=SUPERSEDED`; resume only from the first genuinely unresolved layer.\n5. A `CLOSED / PASS / REMOVED / VERIFIED` layer MUST NOT reopen unless fresh concrete `REGRESSION_EVIDENCE` proves why prior evidence no longer holds.\n6. `ASSIGN != EXECUTION`; another role's result is PROVEN only by fresh durable execution/result evidence, otherwise `NOT_VISIBLE / NOT_PROVEN`.\n7. Immediately before persisting RESULT/NEXT/ROUTE, fresh-read again; if superseded during the run, abort the stale write and re-evaluate.\n8. After two materially equivalent failures, no blind retry without a changed repair path.\n9. No new framework/runner/editor architecture to bypass this guard.\n\nCURRENT VALID #248 RESTART ANCHOR — supersede only with newer valid durable evidence:\n- `OWNER_AUTHORITY = YES`\n- `SOURCE_FREEZE = PASS / VERIFIED`\n- `SOURCE_RECOVERY_BLOCKER = CLOSED`\n- `CURRENT_LESTER_LINUX_RUNTIME_SOURCE_BOUND_EDITOR = BLOCKED`\n- `DO_NOT_RETRY_SAME_LESTER_RUNTIME = YES`\n- `INTEGRATION_NEXT = route existing W01 contract to an already-available capable execution surface, or expose a mature source-bound editor through existing operational tooling without new architecture`\n- first proof on that surface = exact frozen `MASTER FRONT` pixels opened/consumed as the real edit target\n- then `VISUAL -> W01 ARM_RAISE ONLY`\n- `W01 = FAIL-CLOSED / NOT YET PROMOTED`\n- `W02..W06 = STOP`\n- `POSE / CAMERA / S001 = CLOSED`\n- `#248 = NOT PASS`\n- `OWNER_GATE_REQUIRED = NO` unless fresher authority changes it\n\nDurable basis: independent W01 arbitration `5490069155`; PRIME R02 `5494007099`; LESTER capability blocker cited by R02 as #249 comment `5493980288`.\n\nLEGAL FORWARD MOTION ONLY:\n`INTEGRATION -> EXISTING CAPABLE SOURCE-BOUND EXECUTION SURFACE -> exact-source capability proof -> VISUAL W01 -> durable artifact + SHA256 + full W01 matrix -> independent QC`.",
